cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TEDM — Tide-Ebbing Drying Model for the 2026 CUMCM Problem A (herb drying)"
message: >-
  If you use this software or the accompanying model in your research,
  please cite it using the metadata below.  This repository reproduces the
  computational work of a 2026 China Undergraduate Mathematical Contest in
  Modeling (CUMCM / 高教社杯) submission for Problem A.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "CUMCM-2026 Team (Problem A — Herb Drying)"
    note: >-
      Three-person undergraduate team. The numerical code in this repository
      was authored by the programming member.
